From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: flange <flange@localhost>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(adbd): 显式等待 USB worker 退出以恢复热插拔

AOSP StopWorker 通过 pthread_kill(worker, 0) 返回 ESRCH 判断退出。
当前 glibc 对已退出但尚未 join 的线程仍返回 0，monitor 因此永久循环，
主线程等待 monitor，USB open 线程等待 connection 析构，重插后只剩 offline。

复用已有 libbase ScopeGuard，在 worker 所有返回路径设置完成标记；
保留 SIGUSR1 中断阻塞 AIO（异步输入输出），随后正常 join 并重新打开 FunctionFS。

上游：standalone-linux-adbd v36.0.1-linux.2
ADB 源码：78f769e0904c21771cccf6e4e7b239b21800e189（应用上游补丁后）
glibc 行为依据：https://sourceware.org/pipermail/glibc-cvs/2021q3/074935.html
---
diff --git a/daemon/usb.cpp b/daemon/usb.cpp
--- a/daemon/usb.cpp
+++ b/daemon/usb.cpp
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@

 #include <android-base/logging.h>
 #include <android-base/macros.h>
+#include <android-base/scopeguard.h>
 #include <android-base/thread_annotations.h>

 #if defined(__ANDROID__)
@@ -408,6 +409,7 @@
         CHECK(!worker_started_);
         worker_started_ = true;
         worker_thread_ = std::thread([this]() {
+            auto finished = android::base::make_scope_guard([this]() { worker_finished_ = true; });
             adb_thread_setname("UsbFfs-worker");
             VLOG(USB) << "UsbFfs-worker thread spawned";

@@ -441,7 +443,8 @@
         }

         pthread_t worker_thread_handle = worker_thread_.native_handle();
-        while (true) {
+        // glibc 对已退出但未 join 的线程仍返回 0，必须显式等待 worker 完成。
+        while (!worker_finished_) {
             int rc = pthread_kill(worker_thread_handle, kInterruptionSignal);
             if (rc != 0) {
                 LOG(ERROR) << "failed to send interruption signal to worker: " << strerror(rc);
@@ -449,15 +452,6 @@
             }

             std::this_thread::sleep_for(100ms);
-
-            rc = pthread_kill(worker_thread_handle, 0);
-            if (rc == 0) {
-                continue;
-            } else if (rc == ESRCH) {
-                break;
-            } else {
-                LOG(ERROR) << "failed to send interruption signal to worker: " << strerror(rc);
-            }
         }

         worker_thread_.join();
@@ -691,6 +685,7 @@
     std::thread monitor_thread_;

     bool worker_started_;
+    std::atomic<bool> worker_finished_ = false;
     std::thread worker_thread_;

     std::atomic<bool> stopped_;
